 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "workers lists distinct worker names; tasks lists [id, duration] pairs (distinct ids, positive durations) processed in the given order. A worker's workload is the sum of durations of tasks already given to that worker. Level 3 (inferred): as level 2, and additionally worker i can take at most maxTasks[i] tasks; a worker that has reached its limit is no longer eligible. Return the per-worker id lists in worker order followed by one list of unassigned task ids in task order.",
